Z||000002||My7Fieros||09-11-2001||12:46 AM||||Not sure about the 4 bangers because I dont own any, but I have heard from several people w/ the 6 cylinders who have rebuilt their engines that an oversize cam, even slightly, causes cold start nightmares (for whatever reason). I believe it somehow confuses the computer, but dont hold me to that. <BR>4 bangers may take well to a diff cam though, not sure.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 09-11-2001).]||||reg||1
